{"id":166,"slug":"166-picture-element-va-source-dung-the-nao","category":"CSS","subcategory":"Responsive","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"picture element và source dùng thế nào?","question_en":"How are the picture element and source used?","answer_vi":"`<picture>` cho phép **browser chọn giữa các nguồn ảnh khác nhau về định dạng hoặc bố cục**, với `<img>` là phương án cuối.\n\n```html\n<!-- chọn theo ĐỊNH DẠNG: trình duyệt nào hiểu AVIF thì lấy AVIF -->\n<picture>\n  <source srcset=\"/hero.avif\" type=\"image/avif\">\n  <source srcset=\"/hero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n  <img src=\"/hero.jpg\" alt=\"...\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\">\n</picture>\n\n<!-- chọn theo BỐ CỤC (art direction): mobile dùng ảnh cắt dọc -->\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"/hero-portrait.jpg\">\n  <img src=\"/hero-wide.jpg\" alt=\"...\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\">\n</picture>\n```\n\nBrowser duyệt các `<source>` **theo thứ tự và dừng ở cái đầu tiên khớp** — nên định dạng mới nhất phải đứng trước.\n\n**Khi nào dùng `<picture>`, khi nào `srcset`:**\n\n| Nhu cầu | Dùng |\n|---|---|\n| Cùng một ảnh, nhiều kích thước | `<img srcset sizes>` |\n| Đổi **định dạng** (AVIF/WebP + dự phòng) | `<picture>` |\n| Đổi **khung hình / tỉ lệ** theo màn hình | `<picture>` |\n\n**Lưu ý 1:** `alt` **đặt trên `<img>`**, không phải trên `<source>`. Thiếu `<img>` bên trong thì `<picture>` không hiển thị gì.\n\n**Lưu ý 2:** dùng `<picture>` chỉ để đổi kích thước là thừa — `srcset` + `sizes` làm việc đó gọn hơn và để browser tự quyết theo cả DPR lẫn mạng","answer_en":"`<picture>` lets the **browser choose between sources that differ in format or framing**, with `<img>` as the final fallback.\n\n```html\n<!-- by FORMAT: browsers that understand AVIF take AVIF -->\n<picture>\n  <source srcset=\"/hero.avif\" type=\"image/avif\">\n  <source srcset=\"/hero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n  <img src=\"/hero.jpg\" alt=\"...\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\">\n</picture>\n\n<!-- by FRAMING (art direction): a portrait crop on mobile -->\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"/hero-portrait.jpg\">\n  <img src=\"/hero-wide.jpg\" alt=\"...\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\">\n</picture>\n```\n\nThe browser walks the `<source>` list **in order and stops at the first match**, so the newest format must come first.\n\n**When to use `<picture>` versus `srcset`:**\n\n| Need | Use |\n|---|---|\n| Same image, several sizes | `<img srcset sizes>` |\n| Different **format** (AVIF/WebP + fallback) | `<picture>` |\n| Different **crop or aspect ratio** per screen | `<picture>` |\n\n**Note 1:** `alt` belongs **on the `<img>`**, not on `<source>`. Without an inner `<img>`, `<picture>` renders nothing.\n\n**Note 2:** using `<picture>` merely to change size is overkill — `srcset` + `sizes` does it more concisely and lets the browser weigh DPR and network conditions","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> cho phép <strong>browser chọn giữa các nguồn ảnh khác nhau về định dạng hoặc bố cục</strong>, với <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> là phương án cuối.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- chọn theo ĐỊNH DẠNG: trình duyệt nào hiểu AVIF thì lấy AVIF --&gt;\n&lt;picture&gt;\n  &lt;source srcset=&quot;/hero.avif&quot; type=&quot;image/avif&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;source srcset=&quot;/hero.webp&quot; type=&quot;image/webp&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;img src=&quot;/hero.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;...&quot; width=&quot;1200&quot; height=&quot;630&quot;&gt;\n&lt;/picture&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- chọn theo BỐ CỤC (art direction): mobile dùng ảnh cắt dọc --&gt;\n&lt;picture&gt;\n  &lt;source media=&quot;(max-width: 640px)&quot; srcset=&quot;/hero-portrait.jpg&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;img src=&quot;/hero-wide.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;...&quot; width=&quot;1200&quot; height=&quot;630&quot;&gt;\n&lt;/picture&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- chọn theo ĐỊNH DẠNG: trình duyệt nào hiểu AVIF thì lấy AVIF --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">picture</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">source</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">srcset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero.avif&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;image/avif&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">source</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">srcset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero.webp&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;image/webp&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">width</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1200&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">height</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;630&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">picture</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- chọn theo BỐ CỤC (art direction): mobile dùng ảnh cắt dọc --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">picture</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">source</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">media</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;(max-width: 640px)&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">srcset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero-portrait.jpg&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero-wide.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">width</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1200&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">height</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;630&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">picture</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Browser duyệt các <code>&lt;source&gt;</code> <strong>theo thứ tự và dừng ở cái đầu tiên khớp</strong> — nên định dạng mới nhất phải đứng trước.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Khi nào dùng <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code>, khi nào <code>srcset</code>:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Nhu cầu</th><th>Dùng</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cùng một ảnh, nhiều kích thước</td><td><code>&lt;img srcset sizes&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>Đổi <strong>định dạng</strong> (AVIF/WebP + dự phòng)</td><td><code>&lt;picture&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>Đổi <strong>khung hình / tỉ lệ</strong> theo màn hình</td><td><code>&lt;picture&gt;</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý 1:</strong> <code>alt</code> <strong>đặt trên <code>&lt;img&gt;</code></strong>, không phải trên <code>&lt;source&gt;</code>. Thiếu <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> bên trong thì <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> không hiển thị gì.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý 2:</strong> dùng <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> chỉ để đổi kích thước là thừa — <code>srcset</code> + <code>sizes</code> làm việc đó gọn hơn và để browser tự quyết theo cả DPR lẫn mạng.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> lets the <strong>browser choose between sources that differ in format or framing</strong>, with <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> as the final fallback.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- by FORMAT: browsers that understand AVIF take AVIF --&gt;\n&lt;picture&gt;\n  &lt;source srcset=&quot;/hero.avif&quot; type=&quot;image/avif&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;source srcset=&quot;/hero.webp&quot; type=&quot;image/webp&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;img src=&quot;/hero.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;...&quot; width=&quot;1200&quot; height=&quot;630&quot;&gt;\n&lt;/picture&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- by FRAMING (art direction): a portrait crop on mobile --&gt;\n&lt;picture&gt;\n  &lt;source media=&quot;(max-width: 640px)&quot; srcset=&quot;/hero-portrait.jpg&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;img src=&quot;/hero-wide.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;...&quot; width=&quot;1200&quot; height=&quot;630&quot;&gt;\n&lt;/picture&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- by FORMAT: browsers that understand AVIF take AVIF --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">picture</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">source</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">srcset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero.avif&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;image/avif&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">source</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">srcset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero.webp&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;image/webp&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">width</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1200&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">height</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;630&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">picture</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- by FRAMING (art direction): a portrait crop on mobile --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">picture</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">source</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">media</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;(max-width: 640px)&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">srcset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero-portrait.jpg&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero-wide.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">width</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1200&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">height</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;630&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">picture</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">The browser walks the <code>&lt;source&gt;</code> list <strong>in order and stops at the first match</strong>, so the newest format must come first.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>When to use <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> versus <code>srcset</code>:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Need</th><th>Use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Same image, several sizes</td><td><code>&lt;img srcset sizes&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>Different <strong>format</strong> (AVIF/WebP + fallback)</td><td><code>&lt;picture&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>Different <strong>crop or aspect ratio</strong> per screen</td><td><code>&lt;picture&gt;</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note 1:</strong> <code>alt</code> belongs <strong>on the <code>&lt;img&gt;</code></strong>, not on <code>&lt;source&gt;</code>. Without an inner <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> renders nothing.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note 2:</strong> using <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> merely to change size is overkill — <code>srcset</code> + <code>sizes</code> does it more concisely and lets the browser weigh DPR and network conditions.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — <picture>","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/picture"},{"label":"MDN — Responsive images","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Guides/Responsive_images"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/77-cascade-trong-css-nghia-la-gi","title":"Cascade trong CSS nghĩa là gì?"},{"url":"/q/79-inheritance-trong-css-la-gi","title":"Inheritance trong CSS là gì?"},{"url":"/q/80-don-vi-px-em-rem-vw-vh-khac-nhau","title":"Đơn vị px, em, rem, %, vw, vh khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/81-important-dung-khi-nao-tai-sao-nen-tranh","title":"!important dùng khi nào? Tại sao nên tránh?"},{"url":"/q/87-has-selector-la-gi","title":":has() selector là gì?"},{"url":"/q/88-combinator-selectors-space-khac-nhau","title":"Combinator selectors (>, +, ~, space) khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/90-is-where-not-khac-nhau","title":":is(), :where(), :not() khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/91-box-model-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Box model gồm những gì?"}]}